      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: mf_eastyork
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3b9ec1b7a1940328ccc4dc9751d19fd, type: 2}
    DialogueText: So, all I can tell you is that Ralph and Sanjeet, they're staying
      in East York at the minute. I know the Chinese are keeping them there nice
      and cushy.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Okay, right. I'll see what's up.
      NextNodeId: mf_alex
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
